  "html": "<p>Here are some builds that work well in Player versus Environment situations.  Some are for solos, others for running in Groups.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 3 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Fighter_PvE_Builds\" title=\"Category:Fighter PvE Builds\">Fighter PvE Builds</a></li></ul><h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Mage_PvE_Builds\" title=\"Category:Mage PvE Builds\">Mage PvE Builds</a></li></ul><h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Ranger_PvE_Builds\" title=\"Category:Ranger PvE Builds\">Ranger PvE Builds</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"PvE Builds\"</h2>\n<p>There are 15 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/AoE_Mage\" title=\"AoE Mage\">AoE Mage</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Scout\" title=\"Arcane Scout\">Arcane Scout</a></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/BSOL_mage\" title=\"BSOL mage\">BSOL mage</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Ranger\" title=\"Critical Ranger\">Critical Ranger</a></li></ul>\n<h3>H</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Healthy_Obsidian_Mage\" title=\"Healthy Obsidian Mage\">Healthy Obsidian Mage</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>P</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Mage\" title=\"Poison Mage\">Poison Mage</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Ranger\" title=\"Poison Ranger\">Poison Ranger</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Pyromancer_Toasting_Rotgut\" title=\"Pyromancer Toasting Rotgut\">Pyromancer Toasting Rotgut</a></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/SIF_-_Sissirat_Insane_Fighter\" title=\"SIF - Sissirat Insane Fighter\">SIF - Sissirat Insane Fighter</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Summoner\" title=\"Summoner\">Summoner</a></li></ul>\n<h3>T</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tank_With_a_Trick_Up_His_Sleeve\" title=\"Tank With a Trick Up His Sleeve\">Tank With a Trick Up His 